     2	
     3	## 1. Question for the Director
     4	On v012 (arm 3), every empty patch (18/33) is classed as a timeout with zero edits. No row lost its patch to a malformed `edit_file`. One empty row (41 calls) also used up its call budget about 18 s before the timeout, so call exhaustion overlaps there. Even counting it, 1/33 is under the decision rule's threshold of 3. Should I shelve the tool-level lever for the v012 lineage and let plan 010 (thinking 2048) address the time sink? Or do you still want a plan 011 arm?
     5	
